# API Changelog v1 vs. v1


## API Changes

### PATCH /v1/items
- :warning: the response's body minProperties was unset from `8`


### POST /v1/items
-  the request's body minProperties was unset from `8` (media type: */*)
-  the `%20/created` request read-only property's max was decreased to `209.00` (media type: application/json)






